# Testing and benchmarks

Onboarding tests (`hyrox_testing_results`) and performance tests (`hyrox_performance_test_results`) are different flows. Onboarding ski is 1K. Performance-test ski is 2K. Do not store one as the other.

Those tables currently overwrite the latest row. New benchmark history must append. See `docs/contracts/performance-profile.md`.

Athlete submissions stay pending until a coach approves them. Approval does not have to make the row active. Only one active anchor per type.

Do not derive threshold or HYROX pace from a 5K in this layer.
